file caravan/answer.rye the same stub
file caravan/beckon.rye the same stub
file caravan/conclude.rye the same stub
file caravan/desist.rye the same stub
file caravan/farewell.rye the same stub
file caravan/forbear.rye the same stub
file caravan/mind.rye the same stub
file caravan/refrain.rye the same stub
file caravan/respect.rye the same stub
file tools/fixtures/caravan_ladder_carry_scan.sh the carry ceiling lowered to meet the measured reading
file tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish the ceiling assert, the bodies assert, and the fold-queue prose moved to this lap's family
file tools/caravan_ladder_reach_visibility_witness.rish the fall head slid to asked_of, the folded pin slid to read_the_reply, the sink window re-read after the lift
recommend keep-going asked_of leads by fall at 360 and is the first row whose widening names a private constant beside a private function, so the lap that takes it tests whether the lift-underneath answer reaches a value as well as a body; mend_the_plan still leads by carry at 684 and would return only 72, so the fall queue stays the one to read
